# Jakob work branch delivery

- Apply this only when the current branch is `jakeminator123/work`. Never push
  `main`, another person's branch, or unrelated local changes.
- GitLab `scout-gg/croupier` is canonical. GitHub
  `Jakeminator123/github-work` is a private reference copy for browser-GPT;
  it must not become public or be treated as the source of truth.
- Before a shared push, run `node tools/croupier-chef.mjs status` and follow
  `AGENTS.md` ownership instructions. Commit only task-owned files.
- For every approved delivery on this branch, run
  `node tools/push-work-mirrors.mjs`. It checks ancestry, pushes GitLab first,
  then GitHub, and verifies that both branch tips equal local HEAD. If either
  push fails, report the partial state and retry only after resolving it.
- Do not force-push or substitute the retired `gitlab-work` GitHub repo.
- This rule governs agent deliveries; it is not unattended server-side mirroring.
